<text><body>
<milestone n="2" unit="juan"/>
<pb n="0929b" ed="T" xml:id="T45.1909.0929b"/>
<cb:div type="other"><lb n="0929b06" ed="T"/><p xml:id="pT45p0929b0601"><anchor xml:id="nkr_note_orig_0929016" n="0929016"/><anchor xml:id="nkr_note_mod_0929016" n="0929016"/><anchor xml:id="beg0929016" n="0929016"/>願<anchor xml:id="end0929016"/><anchor xml:id="nkr_note_orig_0929017" n="0929017"/><anchor xml:id="nkr_note_mod_0929017" n="0929017"/>以大慈悲力現為我證，令<anchor xml:id="beg_42" type="star"/><note place="inline">某甲</note>等<anchor xml:id="end_42"/>今日發
<lb n="0929b07" ed="T"/>菩提心行菩薩道，在所生處具足成就，所到
<lb n="0929b08" ed="T"/>之地一切解脫。<anchor xml:id="nkr_note_orig_0929018" n="0929018"/><anchor xml:id="nkr_note_mod_0929018" n="0929018"/><anchor xml:id="beg0929018" n="0929018"/>重復至誠<anchor xml:id="end0929018"/>五體投地，<anchor xml:id="nkr_note_orig_0929019" n="0929019"/><anchor xml:id="nkr_note_mod_0929019" n="0929019"/><anchor xml:id="beg0929019" n="0929019"/>頂禮
<lb n="0929b09" ed="T"/>十方一切三寶<anchor xml:id="nkr_note_orig_0929020" n="0929020"/><anchor xml:id="nkr_note_mod_0929020" n="0929020"/><anchor xml:id="beg0929020" n="0929020"/><note place="inline">一拜</note><anchor xml:id="end0929020"/><anchor xml:id="end0929019"/>。</p>
</cb:div>
</body>
<back>
